# Line endings are LF everywhere, checkout included.
#
# This repository is generated by `scripts/sync-guide.mjs` in SBR-Bot, and that
# script writes LF. Without this, a checkout on Windows would arrive with CRLF
# and the drift check would report every file as changed — turning the one
# mechanism that proves the mirror has not been hand-edited into noise.
* text=auto eol=lf
